msgid "Split Coulomb operator treatment (ATTENUATE)"
msgstr "分裂库仑算符处理（ATTENUATE）"

msgid "This directive activates the method described in"
msgstr "该指令启用以下文献中描述的方法"

msgid ""
"Hetzer, M. Schütz, H. Stoll, and H.-J. Werner, *Low-order scaling local "
"electron correlation methods II: Splitting the Coulomb operator in linear "
"scaling local MP2*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1321295>`__ **113**, 9443 (2000)."
msgstr ""
"Hetzer, M. Schütz, H. Stoll, and H.-J. Werner, *Low-order scaling local "
"electron correlation methods II: Splitting the Coulomb operator in linear "
"scaling local MP2*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1321295>`__ **113**, 9443 (2000)."

msgid ""
"This is currently not recommended for general use and we will give no "
"support in case of trouble with this method."
msgstr "目前不推荐将其用于一般用途，若使用此方法遇到问题，我们将不提供支持。"

msgid ""
"The method relies on the partitioning of the Coulomb operator into a rapidly"
" decaying short range part containing the singularity and a smooth long "
"range part. The integrals over both parts of the Coulomb operator are then "
"treated separately. The short range integrals are obtained by transformation"
" of the short range integrals in the AO basis, which is faster than the "
"conventional transformation as more efficient screening is possible. The "
"long range integrals are treated by a multipole expansion. In contrast to "
"conventional multipole expansions, this expansion has an infinite radius of "
"convergence. The method is available by replacing the ``LOCAL`` or ``MULTP``"
" directive by the ``ATTENUATE`` directive."
msgstr ""
"该方法依赖于将库仑算符划分为包含奇点的快速衰减短程部分和平滑的长程部分。然后分别处理库仑算符两部分的积分。短程积分通过在 AO "
"基组中对短程积分进行变换获得，由于可以实现更高效的筛选，这比常规变换更快。长程积分通过多极展开处理。与常规多极展开不同，该展开具有无限收敛半径。通过将 "
"``LOCAL`` 或 ``MULTP`` 指令替换为 ``ATTENUATE`` 指令即可使用该方法。"

msgid "``ATTENUATE,[key1=value],[key2=value2], $\\ldots$``"
msgstr "``ATTENUATE,[key1=value],[key2=value2], $\\ldots$``"

msgid ""
"It does everything the ``MULTP`` directive does (i. e., distant pairs are "
"still treated by ordinary multipole expansion), plus it will enable the "
"split Coulomb operator treatment of weak and strong pairs and select "
"reasonable defaults. See section `summary of options <pao-"
"based_local_correlation_treatments.html#summary-of-options>`__ for details. "
"If you don’t want distant pairs to be treated by ordinary multipole "
"expansion, simply specify ``DISTPAIR=0`` on the ``ATTENUATE`` directive. "
"Note that this method will only work in the context of integral-direct "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"它执行 ``MULTP`` 指令的所有功能（即远对仍通过普通多极展开处理），此外还会启用对弱对和强对的分裂库仑算符处理，并选择合理的默认值。详见 "
"`选项汇总 <pao-based_local_correlation_treatments.html#summary-of-options>`__ "
"一节。如果您不希望远对通过普通多极展开处理，只需在 ``ATTENUATE`` 指令上指定 ``DISTPAIR=0``\\ "
"。请注意，该方法仅在积分直接计算的情形下有效。"

