msgid ""
"The defaults reported for the following options are likely to change in the "
"future."
msgstr "下面各选项报告的默认值将来可能会改变。"

msgid "**Most important options**"
msgstr "**最重要的选项**"

msgid ""
"**``DECAY``\\ =\\ :math:`\\omega`** This is the decay parameter that "
"determines the splitting of the Coulomb operator in the split approach. "
"Larger values of :math:`\\omega` put more weight to the long range part of "
"the operator, which means that the multipole correction will have more "
"difficulties to converge but the transformation of the short range part will"
" be faster. Default: 0.20"
msgstr ""
"**``DECAY``\\ =\\ :math:`\\omega`** 这是决定分裂方法中 Coulomb 算符分裂的衰减参数。\\ "
":math:`\\omega` 的值越大，算符长程部分的权重越大，这意味着多极修正更难收敛，但短程部分的变换会更快。默认值：0.20"

msgid ""
"**``SHORTMLT``\\ =\\ *level*** Determines the expansion level of monopolar "
"multipole expansions in the context of the split Coulomb operator approach. "
"Default: 15"
msgstr "**``SHORTMLT``\\ =\\ *\\ level*** 决定分裂 Coulomb 算符方法中单极多极展开的展开级别。默认值：15"

msgid ""
"**``LONGMLT``\\ =\\ *level*** Determines the expansion level of bipolar "
"multipole expansions in the context of the split Coulomb operator approach. "
"Default: 13"
msgstr "**``LONGMLT``\\ =\\ *\\ level*** 决定分裂 Coulomb 算符方法中双极多极展开的展开级别。默认值：13"

msgid ""
"**Specifying which integrals to treat by which multipole expansion type**"
msgstr "**指定哪些积分由哪种多极展开类型处理**"

msgid ""
"**``RMAIN``\\ =\\ *distance*** When the distance between two orbitals is "
"closer than the absolute value of *distance*, multipole corrections (in the "
"context of the split approximation) will be carried out as monopolar "
"expansions, otherwise a more sophisticated approach will be used involving "
"four expansions for each pair, one for the ordinary dispersion block of the "
"exchange matrix for the given pair, two for the two ionic exchange blocks "
"and one for the exchange-dispersion block (see the section on energy "
"partitioning for explanation of these terms). If *distance* is a positive "
"value, the distance between the orbitals will be taken to be the distance "
"between the closest atoms of the two orbital domains (as in ``WEAKPAIR``, "
"``DISTPAIR`` etc.), if it is a negative value, the distance of the centroids"
" of the two orbitals will be considered. Default: 1"
msgstr ""
"**``RMAIN``\\ =\\ *\\ distance*** 当两个轨道之间的距离小于 *\\ distance\\ * "
"的绝对值时，多极修正（在分裂近似中）将以单极展开进行，否则将使用更复杂的方法，即对每一对涉及四个展开：一个用于给定对的交换矩阵的普通色散块，两个用于两个离子交换块，一个用于交换-"
"色散块（这些术语的解释见能量划分一节）。如果 *\\ distance* 为正值，则轨道之间的距离取为两个轨道域的最近原子之间的距离（如 "
"``WEAKPAIR``\\ 、\\ ``DISTPAIR`` 等），如果为负值，则考虑两个轨道质心之间的距离。默认值：1"

msgid ""
"**``RIONIC``\\ =\\ *distance*** When the distance between two orbitals is "
"closer than *distance* [a.u.], the multipole correction of ionic blocks of "
"the exchange operators will be carried out as monopolar expansion, otherwise"
" a bipolar expansion will be performed. The distance is understood as the "
"distance of the centroids of the two orbitals. Default: 0"
msgstr ""
"**``RIONIC``\\ =\\ *\\ distance*** 当两个轨道之间的距离小于 *\\ distance* [a.u.] "
"时，交换算符离子块的多极修正将以单极展开进行，否则将执行双极展开。距离理解为两个轨道质心之间的距离。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**``SUPPRESS``\\ =\\ *distance*** When the distance between two orbitals "
"(distance of centroids) is higher than the absolute value of *distance* "
"[a.u.], the multipole correction of the exchange-dispersion blocks of the "
"exchange operators is suppressed. If a positive value is given, the "
"multipole correction of the ionic exchange blocks is also suppressed. A zero"
" value disables the suppression of multipole corrections. Default: 0"
msgstr ""
"**``SUPPRESS``\\ =\\ *\\ distance*** 当两个轨道之间的距离（质心距离）大于 *\\ distance* [a.u.]"
" 的绝对值时，交换算符交换-色散块的多极修正被抑制。如果给定正值，离子交换块的多极修正也被抑制。零值禁用多极修正的抑制。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**Options for least squares fit generation of interaction coefficients**"
msgstr "**用于生成相互作用系数的的最小二乘拟合的选项**"

msgid ""
"**``FITMLTP``\\ =\\ *option*** Specifies how the coefficients for the "
"multipole expansion of long range integrals are calculated."
msgstr "**``FITMLTP``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 指定如何计算长程积分多极展开的系数。"

msgid "*option=0*: Taylor expansion"
msgstr "*option=0*\\ ：Taylor 展开"

msgid "*option=1*: Least squares fit"
msgstr "*option=1*\\ ：最小二乘拟合"

msgid "Default: 1"
msgstr "默认值：1"

msgid ""
"**``F1DGRID``\\ =\\ *value*** Sets the number of quadrature points used to "
"generate integrals that arise in the one-dimensional fit (i.e. for the "
"monopolar multipole expansion). Default: 50"
msgstr "**``F1DGRID``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 设置用于生成一维拟合（即单极多极展开）中出现的积分所使用的积分点数目。默认值：50"

msgid ""
"**``F2DGRIDR``\\ =\\ *value*** Sets the number of quadrature points used "
"along the :math:`r` (radial) coordinate when generating integrals for the "
"two-dimensional fit (i.e. for the bipolar multipole expansion). Default: 50"
msgstr ""
"**``F2DGRIDR``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 设置沿 :math:`r`\\ "
"（径向）坐标生成二维拟合（即双极多极展开）积分时所使用的积分点数目。默认值：50"

msgid ""
"**``F2DGRIDP``\\ =\\ *value*** Sets the number of quadrature points used "
"along the :math:`\\phi` (angular) coordinate for the two-dimensional "
"integrals. Default: 20"
msgstr "**``F2DGRIDP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 设置沿 :math:`\\phi`\\ （角向）坐标用于二维积分的积分点数目。默认值：20"

msgid ""
"**``F1DBORDER``\\ =\\ *value*** If greater than 0, sets the upper bound of "
"integration (in bohr) and selects the Gauss–Legendre quadrature for the one-"
"dimensional integrals. If 0, selects Gauss–Laguerre quadrature. Default: 0"
msgstr ""
"**``F1DBORDER``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若大于 0，则设置积分上限（单位为 bohr）并为一维积分选择 "
"Gauss–Legendre 求积。若为 0，则选择 Gauss–Laguerre 求积。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**``F2DBORDER``\\ =\\ *value*** The same for the two-dimensional integrals."
msgstr "**``F2DBORDER``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 对二维积分而言含义相同。"

msgid ""
"**``F1DGAMMA``\\ =\\ :math:`\\gamma`** Sets the negative exponent of the "
"weight function for the one-dimensional fit. Smaller values are better for "
"more diffuse densities. Should be positive (leading to a negative exponent)."
" Default: 1.7"
msgstr ""
"**``F1DGAMMA``\\ =\\ :math:`\\gamma`** "
"设置一维拟合中权重函数的负指数。较小的值更适合较弥散的密度。应为正值（从而得到负指数）。默认值：1.7"

msgid "**``F2DGAMMA``\\ =\\ :math:`\\gamma`** The same for the two-dimensional fit."
msgstr "**``F2DGAMMA``\\ =\\ :math:`\\gamma`** 对二维拟合而言含义相同。"

msgid ""
"**``WEIGHT3D``\\ =\\ *option*** Selects what type of weight function is used"
" for the fits."
msgstr "**``WEIGHT3D``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 选择拟合所使用的权重函数类型。"

msgid "*option=0*: Flat"
msgstr "*option=0*\\ ：平坦"

msgid "*option=1*: Spatial"
msgstr "*option=1*\\ ：空间"

msgid ""
"Remember to change ``F1DGAMMA/F2DGAMMA`` accordingly when using a flat "
"weight function, :math:`\\gamma=1.0` is then a reasonable value. Default: 1"
msgstr ""
"使用平坦权重函数时请记得相应地修改 ``F1DGAMMA/F2DGAMMA``\\ ，此时 :math:`\\gamma=1.0` "
"是合理的取值。默认值：1"

msgid "**Options for determination of batches**"
msgstr "**用于确定批次的选项**"

msgid ""
"**``NUMBATCH``\\ =\\ *value*** If 0, selects automatic determination of the "
"number of batches. If >0, provides a manual override for this number. "
"Default: 0"
msgstr "**``NUMBATCH``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若为 0，则自动确定批次数目。若 >0，则手动覆盖该数目。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**``BATCHDIAM``\\ =\\ *value*** Maximal acceptable diameter of batches. Used"
" to automatically determine the number of batches. If zero, disables batches"
" (i.e., only one batch will be created). Default: 35"
msgstr ""
"**``BATCHDIAM``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** "
"批次可接受的最大直径。用于自动确定批次数目。若为零，则禁用批次（即只创建一个批次）。默认值：35"

msgid ""
"**``BATCHALGO``\\ =\\ *option*** Selects the algorithm used to determine the"
" batches."
msgstr "**``BATCHALGO``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 选择用于确定批次的算法。"

msgid ""
"*option=0*: Manually set batch centres. Three arrays with name ``BATCHX``, "
"``BATCHY``, ``BATCHZ`` have to be set in the input before the ``MP2`` "
"command that contain the :math:`x`-, :math:`y`- and :math:`z`-coordinates of"
" the desired batch centres."
msgstr ""
"*option=0*\\ ：手动设置批次中心。必须在 ``MP2`` 命令之前的输入中设置三个名为 ``BATCHX``\\ 、\\ "
"``BATCHY``\\ 、\\ ``BATCHZ`` 的数组，其中分别包含所需批次中心的 :math:`x`\\ 、\\ :math:`y` 和 "
":math:`z` 坐标。"

msgid ""
"*option=1*: Simple algorithm: Determines a path through the molecules and "
"distributes the batch centres along this path."
msgstr "*option=1*\\ ：简单算法：确定一条贯穿分子的路径，并沿此路径分布批次中心。"

msgid ""
"*option=2*: A robust simulated annealing algorithm. Will only use atom "
"positions as batch centres, might therefore fail for strongly separated "
"dimers and similar systems where there is no atom near the optimal batch "
"centre position."
msgstr ""
"*option=2*\\ "
"：稳健的模拟退火算法。仅使用原子位置作为批次中心，因此在强分离的二聚体及类似系统中可能失败，因为这类系统在最优批次中心位置附近没有原子。"

msgid ""
"*option=3,4*: A less robust simulated annealing algorithm that directly "
"tries to optimize the batches instead of the batch centres."
msgstr "*option=3,4*\\ ：一种稳健性较差的模拟退火算法，直接尝试优化批次而非批次中心。"

msgid "Default: 2"
msgstr "默认值：2"

msgid ""
"**``WEIGHTPREV``\\ =\\ *value*** Affects the one-dimensional path laid "
"through the molecule for ``BATCHALGO=1``. Smaller values mean a more "
"systematic, directed order of atoms from one end to the other. Larger values"
" mean that the distance from one atom in the path to the next will become "
"smaller. Has to be between 0 and 1. Default: 0.5"
msgstr ""
"**``WEIGHTPREV``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 影响 ``BATCHALGO=1`` "
"时贯穿分子的一维路径。较小的值意味着原子从一端到另一端具有更系统、更有方向的顺序。较大的值意味着路径中一个原子到下一个原子的距离将变得更小。必须介于 0"
" 和 1 之间。默认值：0.5"

msgid ""
"**``RANSEED``\\ =\\ *value*** Negative values initialize the random number "
"generator for the simulated annealing algorithms. Positive numbers suppress "
"initialisation of the random number generator. Default: -1"
msgstr "**``RANSEED``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 负值为模拟退火算法初始化随机数生成器。正数则抑制随机数生成器的初始化。默认值：-1"

msgid "**Further numerical stability options**"
msgstr "**其他数值稳定性选项**"

msgid ""
"**``CUTOFF``\\ =\\ *distance*** Applies a simple cutoff to orbitals before "
"the transformation of the multipole operators. Orbital coefficients "
"belonging to AOs that are more than *distance* [a.u.] away from the orbital "
"centre will be deleted. *distance*\\ =0 means don’t use a cutoff. Default: "
"15"
msgstr ""
"**``CUTOFF``\\ =\\ *\\ distance*** 在多极算符变换之前对轨道施加简单的截断。属于距离轨道中心超过 *\\ "
"distance\\ * [a.u.] 的 AO 的轨道系数将被删除。*\\ distance*\\ =0 表示不使用截断。默认值：15"

msgid ""
"**``MONOPOLE``\\ =\\ *option*** Specifies how to treat monopole integrals. "
"Monopole integrals should be zero due to the orthogonality between occupied "
"and virtual orbitals. Therefore, they are usually not included in the "
"calculation. However, this does not hold exactly when an orbital cutoff is "
"applied. Including monopole integrals in the calculation might therefore "
"improve the numerical stability."
msgstr ""
"**``MONOPOLE``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** "
"指定如何处理单极积分。由于占据轨道与虚轨道之间的正交性，单极积分应为零。因此，它们通常不包括在计算中。然而，当施加轨道截断时，这并不严格成立。因此，将单极积分包括在计算中可能会改善数值稳定性。"

msgid "*option=0*: Neglect monopole integrals"
msgstr "*option=0*\\ ：忽略单极积分"

msgid ""
"*option=1*: Use monopole integrals in the translation, but neglect them "
"later on"
msgstr "*option=1*\\ ：在平移中使用单极积分，但稍后忽略它们"

msgid ""
"*option=2*: Use monopole integrals everywhere (translation and expansion), "
"only neglect monopole–\\ :math:`2^{p+1}`\\ pole interactions, where "
":math:`p` is the requested multipole level"
msgstr ""
"*option=2*\\ ：在所有地方（平移和展开）使用单极积分，仅忽略单极–\\ :math:`2^{p+1}`\\ 极相互作用，其中 "
":math:`p` 为所请求的多极级别"

msgid ""
"*option=3*: Use monopole integrals everywhere (translation and expansion), "
"but neglect all monopole–\\ :math:`2^{p+1}`\\ pole, dipole–\\ :math:`2^p`\\ "
"pole, quadrupole–\\ :math:`2^{p-1}`\\ pole interactions and so on. This is "
"entirely consistent, but reduces the effective multipole level by 1 as "
"compared to the other options."
msgstr ""
"*option=3*\\ ：在所有地方（平移和展开）使用单极积分，但忽略所有单极–\\ :math:`2^{p+1}`\\ 极、偶极–\\ "
":math:`2^p`\\ 极、四极–\\ :math:`2^{p-1}`\\ 极等相互作用。这完全自洽，但相比其他选项会将有效多极级别降低 1。"

msgid "**Multipole operators**"
msgstr "**多极算符**"

msgid ""
"**``MAXMLTPL``\\ =\\ *option*** Defines the highest level of multipole "
"operators that are created. Has to be greater or equal than each of "
"``DSTMLT``, ``LONGMLT`` and ``SHORTMLT``, is otherwise overwritten by the "
"default, which is max(``DSTMLT``, ``LONGMLT``, ``SHORTMLT``). Greater values"
" are a useless waste of CPU unless you save the operators for later reuse."
msgstr ""
"**``MAXMLTPL``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 定义所创建的多极算符的最高级别。必须大于或等于 ``DSTMLT``\\ 、\\ "
"``LONGMLT`` 和 ``SHORTMLT`` 中的每一个，否则会被默认值覆盖，默认值为 max(``DSTMLT``, ``LONGMLT``,"
" ``SHORTMLT``)。更大的值只会白白浪费 CPU，除非您保存算符以便日后重复使用。"

msgid ""
"**``MULTPAGE``\\ =\\ *option*** *option=0*: Suppress paging of multipole "
"operators during multipole expansion. After their creation, all operators "
"are read from disk into memory. Will crash if not enough memory is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"**``MULTPAGE``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** *\\ "
"option=0*：在多极展开过程中禁止多极算符分页。算符创建后，所有算符都会从磁盘读入内存。若内存不足则会崩溃。"

msgid ""
"*option=1*: Read operators from disk when needed. Small performance impact."
msgstr "*option=1*\\ ：在需要时从磁盘读取算符。对性能影响较小。"

msgid "**Essentially obsolete option (for Taylor expansions)**"
msgstr "**基本已过时的选项（用于 Taylor 展开）**"

msgid ""
"**``TRUNCATE``\\ =\\ *option*** Determines if the simple or exhaustive "
"truncation truncation scheme will be used for multipole expansions. "
"Exhaustive truncation means that, unlike a classical multipole expansion, "
"all interactions of multipoles up to the highest order are taken into "
"account, e. g. in an expansion of level two, the exhaustive scheme will "
"include quadrupole-quadrupole terms while the simple scheme won’t. Valid "
"options are:"
msgstr ""
"**``TRUNCATE``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** "
"决定多极展开使用简单截断方案还是穷举截断方案。穷举截断意味着，与经典多极展开不同，最高阶以内的所有多极相互作用都会被考虑在内，例如在二级展开中，穷举方案会包括四极-"
"四极项，而简单方案则不会。有效选项为："

msgid "*option=0*: Always use simple truncation."
msgstr "*option=0*\\ ：始终使用简单截断。"

msgid ""
"*option=1*: Use simple truncation for bipolar expansions, but exhaustive "
"truncation for monopolar expansions. This significantly improves convergence"
" when a Taylor expansion is used, but also accelerates the onset of "
"divergent behaviour for large expansion levels and should therefore always "
"be used in connection with a damping function for multipole operators."
msgstr ""
"*option=1*\\ ：对双极展开使用简单截断，但对单极展开使用穷举截断。当使用 Taylor "
"展开时，这会显著改善收敛性，但也会加速大展开级别下发散行为的出现，因此应始终与多极算符的阻尼函数配合使用。"

msgid ""
"*option=2*: Use simple truncation for monopolar expansions, but exhaustive "
"truncation for bipolar expansions including distant pair treatment."
msgstr "*option=2*\\ ：对单极展开使用简单截断，但对包含远对处理的双极展开使用穷举截断。"

msgid "*option=3*: Always use exhaustive truncation."
msgstr "*option=3*\\ ：始终使用穷举截断。"

msgid ""
"The latter two options are not useful and only included for the sake of "
"completeness. Default: 0"
msgstr "后两个选项并无实用价值，仅出于完整性考虑而包含。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**``DAMP``\\ =\\ *order*** Specifies the form of a damping function that is "
"applied to orbitals before the transformation of the multipole operators. "
"*order* is actually the order of a Taylor series that is part of the "
"function and that mimics the behaviour of the monopolar multipole expansion."
" Only multiples of 4 are reasonable values. Higher values mean a harder "
"damping function (i. e. less damping at short distances, but more at long "
"distances). A value of 0 disables the damping. A value of 8 is recommended "
"when using a Taylor expansion. Default: 0"
msgstr ""
"**``DAMP``\\ =\\ *\\ order*** 指定在多极算符变换之前应用于轨道的阻尼函数的形式。*\\ order* 实际上是该函数中 "
"Taylor 级数的阶数，用于模拟单极多极展开的行为。只有 4 "
"的倍数才是合理的取值。较高的值意味着更强的阻尼函数（即在短距离处阻尼较弱，但在长距离处阻尼较强）。值为 0 时禁用阻尼。使用 Taylor "
"展开时推荐取值为 8。默认值：0"

msgid ""
"**``SCALEDAMP``\\ =\\ *scalefactor*** The damping function can additionally "
"be scaled by the value of *scalefactor*. A value lower than 1 means the "
"damping function will be squeezed, while a value higher than 1 will cause it"
" to be stretched. A value of 0 disables the scaling (as well as 1). A value "
"of 0.9 is recommended when using a Taylor expansion. Default: 0"
msgstr ""
"**``SCALEDAMP``\\ =\\ *\\ scalefactor*** 阻尼函数还可以通过 *\\ scalefactor* "
"的值进行缩放。小于 1 的值意味着阻尼函数将被压缩，而大于 1 的值将使其被拉伸。值为 0 时禁用缩放（与 1 相同）。使用 Taylor "
"展开时推荐取值为 0.9。默认值：0"

msgid "**Stuff for debugging**"
msgstr "**调试相关**"

msgid ""
"**``PAIREN``\\ =\\ *option*** Prints a list of uncoupled pair energies "
"before the MP2 iterations. Can be used as a convenient diagnostic when "
"getting totally implausible correlation energies or no convergence or "
"\"UNREASONABLE NORM\" messages."
msgstr ""
"**``PAIREN``\\ =\\ *\\ option*** 在 MP2 迭代之前打印未耦合对能列表。当得到完全不合理相关能、出现不收敛或出现 "
"\"UNREASONABLE NORM\" 消息时，可作为便捷的诊断手段。"
